{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "onboarding-engine-v1",
    "name": "ConnectX — Dynamic Onboarding Engine v1",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap endpoint Dynamic Onboarding Engine sesuai API Contract CON-48. Covers 5 endpoint utama: start session, get current step, submit answer, go back, dan get full session state. Semua 6 flow (Common, A, B, C, D, E, F) sudah di-cover oleh test scenario.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Sanctum Bearer Token dari Login/Verify WhatsApp" },
    { "key": "session_id", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Diisi otomatis setelah POST /sessions berhasil" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth — Login (Dapatkan Token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login with Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login/password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login", "password"] },
            "description": "Dapatkan Bearer Token dulu sebelum mulai onboarding. Token ini dipakai di semua request berikutnya via Authorization header.\n\n⚠️ Pastikan account sudah melewati tahap verifikasi (registration_step >= 5) atau gunakan akun test yang sudah fully verified."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token saved:', json.token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Start Onboarding Session",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id", "description": "Ganti ke 'en' untuk response Bahasa Inggris" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"locale\": \"id\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["onboarding", "sessions"]
        },
        "description": "## POST /api/v1/onboarding/sessions\n\n**Tujuan:** Membuat sesi onboarding baru atau melanjutkan sesi yang masih `in_progress`.\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Jika user sudah punya sesi `in_progress` → dikembalikan sesi lama (resume, tidak dibuatkan baru)\n- Jika belum ada → sistem cari `onboarding_flows` dengan `is_entry = true` → `flow_common` → ambil step pertama (`step_personal_name`)\n- Selalu return HTTP 201\n\n**Response 201 (sukses):**\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"ses_xXxXxXxXxX\",\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"current_step\": {\n    \"id\": \"step_personal_name\",\n    \"flow_key\": \"flow_common\",\n    \"section\": \"Data Diri\",\n    \"section_progress\": \"1/4\",\n    \"overall_progress\": { \"current\": 1, \"total\": 12 },\n    \"title\": \"Siapa nama Anda?\",\n    \"subtitle\": null,\n    \"questions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"q_first_name\",\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"label\": \"Nama Depan\",\n        \"required\": true,\n        \"validation\": { \"min_length\": 1, \"max_length\": 50 },\n        \"options\": []\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"q_last_name\",\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"label\": \"Nama Belakang\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"helper_text\": null,\n        \"options\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"cta\": { \"label\": \"Continue\", \"enabled_when\": \"valid\" },\n    \"can_go_back\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** `Accept-Language: id` untuk response dalam Bahasa Indonesia, `en` untuk Bahasa Inggris."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.test('Has session_id', () => {",
              "  const json = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('session_id');",
              "  pm.expect(json.session_id).to.match(/^ses_/);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', json.session_id);",
              "  console.log('✅ Session ID saved:', json.session_id);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Status is in_progress', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.equal('in_progress');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Has current_step with questions', () => {",
              "  const step = pm.response.json().current_step;",
              "  pm.expect(step).to.have.property('id');",
              "  pm.expect(step).to.have.property('questions');",
              "  pm.expect(step.questions).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Get Current Step (Resume/Reload)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/current",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "current"]
        },
        "description": "## GET /api/v1/onboarding/sessions/:session_id/current\n\n**Tujuan:** Mengambil step saat ini tanpa mengubah state. Dipakai untuk:\n- Resume setelah app crash/close\n- Reload halaman onboarding\n- Prefill form dengan jawaban sebelumnya (jika user sudah pernah isi)\n\n**Response 200 (session in_progress):**\n```json\n{\n  \"current_step\": {\n    \"id\": \"step_personal_name\",\n    \"flow_key\": \"flow_common\",\n    \"section\": \"Data Diri\",\n    \"section_progress\": \"1/4\",\n    \"overall_progress\": { \"current\": 1, \"total\": 12 },\n    \"title\": \"Siapa nama Anda?\",\n    \"questions\": [ ... ],\n    \"cta\": { \"label\": \"Continue\", \"enabled_when\": \"valid\" },\n    \"can_go_back\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Response 200 (session sudah completed):**\n```json\n{\n  \"next_step\": null,\n  \"completed\": true,\n  \"profile_id\": \"uuid-user-id\",\n  \"redirect_to\": \"/home\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response 403:** Jika session bukan milik user yang sedang login."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Response has current_step or completed', () => {",
              "  const json = pm.response.json();",
              "  const valid = json.current_step !== undefined || json.completed === true;",
              "  pm.expect(valid).to.be.true;",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Submit Answer — Flow Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 ✅ Step 1: Nama (Valid)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_name\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_first_name\": \"Dimas\",\n    \"q_last_name\": \"Pratama\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
            },
            "description": "## POST /api/v1/onboarding/sessions/:session_id/answer\n\n**Step:** `step_personal_name` — Nama Depan & Belakang\n\n**Rules:**\n- `q_first_name`: required, min_length: 1, max_length: 50\n- `q_last_name`: optional (boleh dikosongkan)\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_personal_dob` (Tanggal Lahir)\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"next_step\": {\n    \"id\": \"step_personal_dob\",\n    \"title\": \"Kapan tanggal lahir Anda?\",\n    \"questions\": [\n      { \"id\": \"q_dob\", \"type\": \"date\", \"label\": \"Tanggal Lahir\", \"required\": true }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"progress\": { \"current\": 2, \"total\": 12 },\n  \"can_go_back\": true\n}\n```"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('next_step is step_personal_dob', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.next_step.id).to.equal('step_personal_dob');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 ❌ Step 1: Nama (Validation Error — Nama Kosong)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_name\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_first_name\": \"\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
            },
            "description": "**Test validasi 422:** Nama depan kosong pada field yang required.\n\n**Expected Response 422:**\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"The given data was invalid.\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"q_first_name\": [\n      \"'Nama Depan' wajib untuk diisi.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Kode sumber validasi:** `OnboardingEngineService::validateAnswers()` di baris ~187"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('Has errors.q_first_name', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('errors');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.errors).to.have.property('q_first_name');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 ✅ Step 2: Tanggal Lahir",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_dob\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_dob\": \"1995-08-17\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
            },
            "description": "**Step:** `step_personal_dob` — Tanggal Lahir\n\n**Format:** YYYY-MM-DD (ISO 8601)\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_personal_location`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('next_step is step_personal_location', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().next_step.id).to.equal('step_personal_location');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 ✅ Step 3: Lokasi + depends_on Remote",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_location\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_location\": \"jakarta\",\n    \"q_open_remote\": \"yes\",\n    \"q_remote_pref\": \"hybrid\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
            },
            "description": "**Step:** `step_personal_location` — Lokasi + Remote Preference\n\n**Logic `depends_on` di step ini:**\n- `q_remote_pref` hanya **wajib divalidasi** jika `q_open_remote === 'yes'`\n- Jika user pilih `q_open_remote: 'no'`, field `q_remote_pref` boleh dikirim kosong\n\n**Test Case A (Remote = Yes, dengan Preference):** Seperti body di atas → 200 ✅\n\n**Test Case B (Remote = No, tanpa Preference):**\n```json\n{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_location\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_location\": \"singapore\",\n    \"q_open_remote\": \"no\"\n  }\n}\n```\n→ Juga 200 ✅ karena `q_remote_pref` punya `depends_on` ke `q_open_remote = yes`\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_personal_gender`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('next_step is step_personal_gender', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().next_step.id).to.equal('step_personal_gender');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3.5 ✅ Step 4: Gender",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_personal_gender\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_gender\": \"male\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
            },
            "description": "**Step:** `step_personal_gender`\n\n**Valid values:** `male`, `female` (dari `onboarding_options`)\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_role_selection` — ini adalah **PERCABANGAN UTAMA** flow"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('next_step is step_role_selection (branching point)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().next_step.id).to.equal('step_role_selection');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "── BRANCH: Pilih FOUNDER (→ Flow Builder Common) ──",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "3.6A Step 5: Role = founder → Flow Builder",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_role_selection\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_use_connectx\": \"founder\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
                },
                "description": "**🔀 BRANCHING POINT — Memilih Founder**\n\nTransisi di DB:\n```json\n{\n  \"from_step_id\": \"step_role_selection\",\n  \"condition\": { \"question_id\": \"q_use_connectx\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"value\": \"startup\" },\n  \"to_step_id\": \"step_flow_f\",\n  \"priority\": 1\n}\n```\nKarena value = `founder` (bukan `startup`), kondisi priority 1 TIDAK terpenuhi → fallback ke transisi tanpa syarat → lompat ke `step_bld_exp` di `flow_builder_common`.\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_bld_exp` (Pengalaman Startup Sebelumnya)\n\n**Valid values untuk q_use_connectx:**\n- `founder` → flow_builder_common\n- `cofounder` → flow_builder_common  \n- `team` → flow_builder_common\n- `startup` → flow_f (langsung)"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                      "pm.test('next_step is step_bld_exp (Builder Common)', () => {",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().next_step.id).to.equal('step_bld_exp');",
                      "});"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "3.7A Step: Pengalaman Startup",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_bld_exp\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_startup_exp\": \"founder_exp\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
                },
                "description": "**Valid values:** `founder_exp`, `employee_exp`, `no_exp`\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_bld_industry`"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3.8A Step: Industri + Komitmen + Relocate",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_bld_industry\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_industry\": [\"AI/ML\", \"Fintech\", \"SaaS\"],\n    \"q_availability\": \"full_time\",\n    \"q_relocate\": \"yes\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
                },
                "description": "**Multi-select:** `q_industry` max 5 item\n\n**Valid availability values:** `full_time`, `part_time`, `side_project`, `open_to_discussion`\n\n**Expected next_step:** `step_bld_role`"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3.9A ❌ Industri Terlalu Banyak (max 5)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_bld_industry\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_industry\": [\"AI/ML\", \"Fintech\", \"SaaS\", \"EdTech\", \"Web3\", \"Gaming\"],\n    \"q_availability\": \"full_time\",\n    \"q_relocate\": \"yes\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
                },
                "description": "**Test validasi max_selections:** 6 industri dipilih, padahal max 5.\n\n**Expected Response 422:**\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"The given data was invalid.\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"q_industry\": [\n      \"Anda mencentang terlalu banyak! Maksimum 5 buah pada pilihan 'Pilih Industri (Maks 5)'.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Status 422 - too many selections', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                      "pm.test('Error on q_industry', () => {",
                      "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().errors).to.have.property('q_industry');",
                      "});"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "3.10A Step: Peran + LinkedIn",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"step_id\": \"step_bld_role\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"q_role_desc\": \"cto\",\n    \"q_role_years\": 5,\n    \"q_linkedin\": \"https://linkedin.com/in/dimasfoo\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/onboarding/sessions/{{session_id}}/answer",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["onboarding", "sessions", "{{session_id}}", "answer"]
                },
                "description": "**Step:** `step_bld_role`\n\n`q_linkedin` adalah optional (required: false) — boleh dikirim kosong.\n\n**Transitional Branching setelah step ini:**\n- Jika `q_use_connectx = founder` → ke `step_founder_intent`\n- Jika `q_use_connectx = cofounder` → ke `step_flow_d`\n- Jika `q_use_connectx = team` → ke `step_flow_e`\n\nKarena kita pilih `founder` di step 5 → **Expected next_step:** `step_founder_intent`"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3.11A Step: Founder Intent → SUB-BRANCHING",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "id" }
                ],
